{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1443443-what-anime-manga-tv-show-cartoon-video-game-cross-over-better-with-exalted","id":1443443,"title":"What anime/manga/tv show/cartoon/video game cross over better with Exalted","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-10T23:25:45-07:00","id":1443443,"title":"What anime/manga/tv show/cartoon/video game cross over better with Exalted","content":"Ex. My hero academia","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-11T01:18:31-07:00","id":1443447,"title":"","content":"Monty Oum's fight scenes (seen in RWBY, Dead Fantasy, later seasons of Red vs. Blue) are everything Exalted combat wants to be.<br /> <br /> But regarding stories, I'm a sucker for the Game of Thrones vibe. Strong personalities in constant tension, corrupt government by and for a sprawling noble family, with fantasy elements shaping and threatening the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T10:56:29-07:00","id":1443615,"title":"","content":"<i>Twelve Kingdoms</i> obviously fits well due to sharing similar inspirations.<br /> <br /> I've already gone into detail on how <i>Tales of Innocence</i> is such a close parallel to Exalted that it's almost suspicious. (You play a party of reincarnated heroes from a lost heroic age, who manifest their powers when a column of - in the hero's case, golden - light erupts from them and they suddenly inherit all their previous incarnation's skills. Then you have to flee because an ancient conspiracy wants to eliminate you. It eventually turns out that the heroic age ended when you were betrayed and killed by your advisors and servants, who wanted to protect the world from what they saw as your madness.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T11:17:28-07:00","id":1443619,"title":"","content":"Obvious Avatar:The Last Airbender reference","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T11:31:09-07:00","id":1443622,"title":"","content":"Been watching a ton of donghua lately, both Heavenly Official's Blessing and Soulmate Adventure are quality Exalted fodder.<br /> <br /> Blood of Zeus is solid, albeit better for Scion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-12T12:12:18-07:00","id":1443626,"title":"","content":"My Little Pony: Friendship Is Magic<br /> <br /> ...it has a sun god and a moon god as prominent supporting characters, it features emotion-eating changelings, a wide variety of monsters and magical creatures you can encounter - it can IMO quite easily be crossed over with Exalted","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avata